+ * 50HX + 170HX Gen2 sequence, as verified on those cards:
+ *   170HX: program speed path after Booter / before GSP-RM (late-config
+ *           in kernel_gsp_booter_tu102.c). Userspace hammer does RL.
+ *   50HX:  after nv_start_device, write LTSSM, set TLS, one Retrain-Link,
+ *           poll. Never LnkCap, never Link Disable.
+ * 90HX extra vs 50HX: GSP init overwrites LINK_CONFIG/PRIV_MISC/PL_RATE,
